          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Have an upcoming first or challenging case? Be paired 1:1 with expert faculty for training tailored to your schedule and learning needs.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Product and procedure didactics<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Case review</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Case proctoring<br>\n </span></li>\n</ul>\n",
